==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[trap door]]
* [[trap-door]]

===Etymology===
{{term|trap}} + {{term|door}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[hinged]] or [[sliding]] [[door]] set into a [[floor]] or [[ceiling]].
# {{context|theater}} Such a [[trap]] set into the floor of a [[stage]] to allow fast [[exit]]s and [[entrance]]s.
# {{computing}} A [[secret]] method of obtaining [[access]] to a [[program]] on [[online]] [[system]]; a [[backdoor]].

====Synonyms====
* [[drop]]

====Derived terms====
* [[trapdoor spider]]

